{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Sesame Crusted Tuna",
  "text": "Sesame Crusted Tuna\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\nolive oil\n\n4 tuna steaks\n\nsesame seed (I haven't listed quantity as it will vary for size of steaks, but enough to cover one side of tuna)\n\n18 g paste miso\n\n3 tablespoons mirin\n\n3 tablespoons sake\n\n2 tablespoons sugar\n\n2 tablespoons rice vinegar\n\n2 teaspoons Japanese soy sauce\n\n1/4 teaspoon wasabi\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Cover one side of tuna completely with sesame seeds and place steaks back in fridge.\n\n2. Combine all the other ingredients in a saucepan heat until blended and sugar has dissolved. Leave on low heat to keep warm.\n\n3. Heat some olive oil in a fry pan, place Tuna sesame seed side down cook for 4 minutes turn over and cook on the other side for a further 4 minutes.\n\n4. Serve tuna on plate with dipping sauce in separate small serving bowls.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "olive oil",
    "4 tuna steaks",
    "sesame seed (I haven't listed quantity as it will vary for size of steaks, but enough to cover one side of tuna)",
    "18 g paste miso",
    "3 tablespoons mirin",
    "3 tablespoons sake",
    "2 tablespoons sugar",
    "2 tablespoons rice vinegar",
    "2 teaspoons Japanese soy sauce",
    "1/4 teaspoon wasabi"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Cover one side of tuna completely with sesame seeds and place steaks back in fridge."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Combine all the other ingredients in a saucepan heat until blended and sugar has dissolved. Leave on low heat to keep warm."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Heat some olive oil in a fry pan, place Tuna sesame seed side down cook for 4 minutes turn over and cook on the other side for a further 4 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Serve tuna on plate with dipping sauce in separate small serving bowls."
    }
  ]
